-- ============================================================================
-- v1416: Seed / sample data — Production Readiness registers (v1415) for the demo project
-- ============================================================================
-- Owner request 2026-11-11: sample data where it was missing, 10 records for each Production Readiness register,
-- for SEED334-PRJ-08 (fictional "Northbridge Bank" technology programme, Information Technology pack).
-- Same scenario as the v1374 Architecture samples: the Northbridge Bank technology programme replacing
-- two legacy cores, go-live 10–12 April 2027. Dated around today (11 Nov 2026): monitoring, logging and
-- support are being built, earlier small go-lives are stabilised and Release 1 is pending. Documents are Draft.
-- Records: op_readiness 10, monitoring 10, logging 10, support_model 10, runbooks 10, dr 10, go_live 10.
-- Vendor-neutral (rule 26), person fields are plain text. display_id is left blank so Admin ID
-- Generation assigns it (rule 16.2). Fixed hex-only ids …-4000-a037- … a03d- (ranges checked free
-- before use). ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING, and nothing is inserted if the project is missing.
-- Calculated values are worked out with the same rules as the app. The final query counts the
-- records per register, so a skipped insert is visible.
-- Prerequisites: v1415. Idempotent.
-- ============================================================================

